            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda ne yanlış?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This session will expire in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"alert\"</code> değeri çift tırnak içermelidir </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey, bende çalışıyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"alert\"</code> değeri çift tırnak içermelidir .</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tırnaksız <code>alert</code> değeri geçerli HTML'dir.</p><p>Hangi düzenleme kapsayıcının ilettiği acil mesaj anlamını değiştirir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This session will expire in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">role özniteliğinde alert yerine contentinfo kullan.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">alert çevresine çift tırnak koy.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mesaj metninden sonraki boşluğu kaldır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">role özniteliğinde alert yerine contentinfo kullan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
